values ('ap_physics_1', 2, '2.3', array['2.3']::text[], 'vocabulary', 'Ideal string', 'An ideal string has negligible mass and does not stretch under tension, so the tension is the same at all points within it.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'A string with nonnegligible mass can have different tension at different points (e.g., a hanging chain has greater tension toward the top); AP Physics 1 asks only for a qualitative description of this.', 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-physics-1-reference-u1-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_physics_1-u2-r2-004; ced=2.3.A.3.i-ii ''An ideal string has negligible mass and does not stretch when under tension''; ''The tension in an ideal string is the same at all points within the string''')
