values ('ap_physics_1', 2, '2.5', array['2.5']::text[], 'convention', 'Direction of acceleration and when velocity changes', 'A system''s center-of-mass acceleration points in the same direction as the net force exerted on the system, and the velocity of the system''s center of mass changes only if a nonzero net external force is exerted on that system.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-physics-1-reference-u1-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_physics_1-u2-r3-001; ced=2.5.A.2 ''in the same direction as that net force''; 2.5.A.3 ''will only change if a nonzero net external force is exerted on that system''; product-owner-directed correction by the Claude session (David, 2026-10-10): the escalated row was corrected against its own CED evidence and re-checked by both independent checkers and the own-family veto')
